# ESP-IDF build output
build/

# Generated from sdkconfig.defaults. Not tracked, because it is a derived file --
# sdkconfig.defaults is the source of truth. See the skill: editing the defaults
# has no effect once this file exists, so regenerate rather than hand-edit.
sdkconfig
sdkconfig.old

# Fetched by the component manager.
managed_components/

# NOTE: dependencies.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. It pins the exact resolved
# component versions. On the previous Tab5 project it was ignored, and the display
# BSP silently moved a minor version on a fresh resolve with nothing in the diff
# to show for it.

# Credentials. Only .env.example is tracked.
.env
# Belt and braces: if anyone follows PLAN.md's secrets.h route instead, that
# must not be committed either.
main/secrets.h
secrets.h

.DS_Store
